  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">StarthilfePlus 2021 - Enhanced Reintegration Assistance for Voluntary Returnees from Germany</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to contribute to the sustainable reintegration of migrants voluntarily returning from Germany to their country of origin or another receiving country. Migrants are supported in their reintegration process through cash and/or in-kind reintegration assistance. The programme addresses important needs returnees often face upon their return, such as housing and health as well as general socio-economic needs.</narrative>
  </description>
